    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The tax-software company Intuit announced a workforce reduction targeting roughly 17% of its staff, with the company leader framing the move as a necessary reinvention. The decree handed down from the top eliminates about 3,000 full-time roles, leaving the 3,000 displaced to reckon with a severance package meant to soften the blow of offices in Reno and Woodland Hills winding down.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Outlaw",
        "fragments": [
          "why-1",
          "how-0",
          "result-0",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "center": "who-2",
        "center_kind": "who",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 0
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.9
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "A bloodletting of nearly one-fifth of the workforce is underway at the corporate entity, where the chief executive enforcing the cut cited a business strategy to chase the AI hype at human cost. The affected employees, now the 3,000 displaced, were offered a calculated buyout of loyalty—16 weeks of base pay plus two weeks per year of tenure—as site closures in Reno and Woodland Hills proceed.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Outlaw",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "center": "result-0",
        "center_kind": "result",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 1
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "Intuit's stated justification for the organizational change rings hollow to many, a familiar corporate alibi for mass layoffs masked as a move to co-locate teams. The workforce bearing the cost of this 'reinvention' faces significant reduction in headcount, with a severance compensation offer as the only concession from the company.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Outlaw",
        "fragments": [
